{
    "_comment": [
        "Per-window-kind layout for TP messages. The kind is the fuki_kind byte",
        "of each message's INF1 attributes (see window_kinds.py / TAGS.md).",
        "warn_width / max_width are the editable base .blo widths for each window",
        "kind in font pixels, before regional or HIO scaling. The default entry",
        "covers every talk variant; numeric",
        "kind entries override it for other windows. Explicit per-string",
        "overrides always win. font_file picks the BFN font for the kind",
        "(empty = default font).",
        "lines_per_page follows non-JP getLineMax: kanban kinds 2/6/15 -> 7,",
        "staff 7 -> 10, save 16 -> 6, all others including jimaku/place/boss -> 4.",
        "Kind 15 is Talk visuals with kanban pagination (not a wooden sign).",
        "An optional 'name' labels the kind in the editor (preview badge and the",
        "Window: label). Unknown kinds show as 'Dialogue (kind N)' - to classify",
        "one (e.g. the ring-menu item info screen), add its number here."
    ],
